        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cxWIyGRpqySWdvmEkcNW-2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontColor=#000000;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot; face=&quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;&gt;This diagram shows how a road traffic monitoring system organizes its data. Each sensor is installed on one road segment, and a road segment can have multiple sensors. A sensor can take part in multiple monitoring campaigns, and each campaign can use multiple sensors. The SensorCampaign table records which sensors are used in each campaign.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="592" x="40" y="361" as="geometry" />
